Create edge case test suite for engine.

Test boundary conditions and unusual but valid inputs.

## Acceptance Criteria
- [ ] Test BPM at minimum (20) and maximum (300) values
- [ ] Test zero-length pattern
- [ ] Test all 16 tracks active simultaneously
- [ ] Test maximum polyphony (all synth voices active)
- [ ] Test export with 0 sections in song mode
- [ ] Test rapid play/stop toggling
- [ ] Test loading empty project file
- [ ] No crashes or undefined behavior in any edge case

## Test Plan
- [ ] Build and run edge_case_test target
- [ ] Each edge case produces expected behavior (no crash, correct output or graceful error)
- [ ] Run under ASan and UBSan
